§§ `The General Division's additional powers (First Schedule)`
-- Situation: asked of a party to a case in the High Court, about a power the court may use in it. The form can ask "Is your case in the General Division of the High Court?" first; any other answer returns NOT COVERED.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- schedule 1 paragraph 1.
@export Under schedule 1 paragraph 1, can the court issue a direction, order or writ to a person or authority?
GIVEN `the court` IS A `scja3 Which court` @desc In which court is your case?
      `which order or writ` IS A `sch 1 para 1 the order or writ` @desc Which kind of direction, order or writ is it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under schedule 1 paragraph 1, can the court issue a direction, order or writ to a person or authority` IS
    `sch 1 para 1 the court may issue the direction, order or writ to a person or authority` (`scja3 my court` `the court`) `which order or writ`

-- schedule 1 paragraph 2.
@export Under schedule 1 paragraph 2, can the court partition the land or direct a sale instead of partition?
GIVEN `the court` IS A `scja3 Which court` @desc In which court is your case?
      `the action is an action for partition of land` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the action an action for partition of land?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under schedule 1 paragraph 2, can the court partition the land or direct a sale instead of partition` IS
    `sch 1 para 2 the court may partition land or direct a sale instead of partition` (`scja3 my court` `the court`) `the action is an action for partition of land`

-- schedule 1 paragraph 2.
@export Under schedule 1 paragraph 2, can the court order the land sold in a cause or matter relating to land?
GIVEN `the court` IS A `scja3 Which court` @desc In which court is your case?
      `the cause or matter relates to land` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the cause or matter relate to land?
      `it appears to the court necessary or expedient that the land or part of it be sold` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it appear to the court necessary or expedient that the land or part of it be sold?
